        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Clarissa Eden, Anthony Eden\n- Roles: Dowager Countess of Avon, 1st Earl of Avon, Foreign Secretary, Prime Minister of the United Kingdom\n- Topics: British politics, family relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Anthony Eden was born on 12 June 1897.\n- Anthony Eden was a British Conservative politician who served three periods as Foreign Secretary.\n- Anthony Eden served as Prime Minister of the United Kingdom from 1955 to 1957.\n- Clarissa Eden was born Anne Clarissa Spencer-Churchill on 28 June 1920.\n- Clarissa Eden became the widow of Anthony Eden, 1st Earl of Avon, after his death in 1977.\n- Clarissa Eden held the title Dowager Countess of Avon.",
